modes:
  - file: annotated_dailies_export
    load: immediate

description: |
  <p>Exports every clip in the current playlist that has annotations as its own
  movie, with the annotations burned in, plus a still of each annotated frame.
  Uses rvio on a temporary copy of the session.</p>
  <p>Menu: Annotated Dailies &gt; Export Annotated Clips...</p>
  <p>Set RVIO_PATH if rvio is not next to rv or on your PATH.</p>
